 "text": "- Token figures are platform-accounting values, not visible word counts.", "id": "META-03-L000057", "message_id": "META-03-preamble", "message_start": false}, {"number": 58, "text": "- Cached input tokens are included in input tokens, not added to them.", "id": "META-03-L000058", "message_id": "META-03-preamble", "message_start": false}, {"number": 59, "text": "- Reasoning output tokens are a subset of output tokens; only their count is retained.", "id": "META-03-L000059", "message_id": "META-03-preamble", "message_start": false}, {"number": 60, "text": "- Input accounting includes repeated context, system instructions, tool schemas and tool results.", "id": "META-03-L000060", "message_id": "META-03-preamble", "message_start": false}, {"number": 61, "text": "- Top-level exec records may orchestrate multiple semantic tool operations.", "id": "META-03-L000061", "message_id": "META-03-preamble", "message_start": false}, {"number": 62, "text": "- The figures do not by themselves establish monetary cost, energy use or carbon emissions.", "id": "META-03-L000062", "message_id": "META-03-preamble", "message_start": false}, {"number": 63, "text": "- Hidden reasoning content, system instructions and raw tool telemetry remain excluded.", "id": "META-03-L000063", "message_id": "META-03-preamble", "message_start": false}, {"number": 64, "text": "- When an archive spans multiple source segments, the cumulative token snapshot comes from the latest segment and may not include earlier segments.", "id": "META-03-L000064", "message_id": "META-03-preamble", "message_start": false}]}